{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37567","headline":"李夷遇侍御久滞水乡因抒寄怀 · 郑谷","name":"李夷遇侍御久滞水乡因抒寄怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"簪豸年何久，悬帆兴甚长。\n江流爱吴越，诗格愈齐梁。\n竹寺晴吟远，兰洲晚泊香。\n高闲徒自任，华省待爲郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}